@@ -0,0 +1,8 @@
+---
+features:
+  - Add ``multiplier`` (default 1) to ``wait_exponential_jitter`` for consistency
+    with the other exponential wait strategies.
+deprecations:
+  - The ``initial`` argument to ``wait_exponential_jitter`` is deprecated.
+    Existing keyword and positional uses emit ``DeprecationWarning``. Passing
+    both ``initial`` and ``multiplier`` raises ``ValueError``.
